@* PWA (beginscherm-app) — gedeelde <head>-tags voor _LayoutV2 en _Layout. Manifest/iconen/service worker
   staan in wwwroot (manifest.json, icons/, sw.js, offline.html); gedrag in js/pwa.js, stijl in
   css/gl-v2-pwa.css. De viewport-tag zelf staat in elke layout (viewport-fit=cover is daar al gezet).
   theme-color = --gl-v2-primary (#00532D, gl-v2-tokens.css). *@
<link rel="manifest" href="~/manifest.json" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#00532D" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="~/icons/icon-180.png" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="CPM" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/gl-v2-pwa.css" asp-append-version="true" />
<script src="~/js/pwa.js" asp-append-version="true" defer></script>
